§ `Appraisal rights: section 262, subsections (g) to (l)`

-- The Court directed me to submit my certificates and I have not.
#ASSERT `May the Court dismiss the proceedings as to me for not submitting my stock certificates` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- My stock is uncertificated.
#ASSERT NOT (`May the Court dismiss the proceedings as to me for not submitting my stock certificates` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- I complied.
#ASSERT NOT (`May the Court dismiss the proceedings as to me for not submitting my stock certificates` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- Listed, 100 of 100,000 shares for appraisal (0.1%), consideration $500,000, not a short-form merger: the Court must dismiss.
#ASSERT `Must the Court dismiss the proceedings as to all holders of my listed shares` TRUE 100 100000 500000 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 1,001 shares (just over 1%).
#ASSERT `Must the Court dismiss the proceedings as to all holders of my listed shares` TRUE 1001 100000 500000 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Exactly 1% and exactly $1 million do not exceed.
#ASSERT `Must the Court dismiss the proceedings as to all holders of my listed shares` TRUE 1000 100000 1000000 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not listed.
#ASSERT `Must the Court dismiss the proceedings as to all holders of my listed shares` FALSE 100 100000 500000 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A short-form merger under s 253 or s 267.
#ASSERT `Must the Court dismiss the proceedings as to all holders of my listed shares` TRUE 100 100000 500000 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: more shares entitled than outstanding.
#ASSERT `Must the Court dismiss the proceedings as to all holders of my listed shares` TRUE 100001 100000 500000 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The Court finds $1,000,000 including the effect of the transaction, of which $150,000 arises from it: the fair value is $850,000.
#ASSERT `What is the fair value of my shares, leaving out the effect of the transaction` 1000000 150000 EQUALS 850000

-- Fair value $100,000; two whole quarters at a discount rate of 3% (each quarter 2%): interest $4,040.
#ASSERT `How much interest will I be paid on the fair value` 100000 FALSE 0 (LIST 3%, 3%) 0 EQUALS JUST 4040
-- Ten days into a further quarter: the text gives no rule for the part-quarter.
#ASSERT `How much interest will I be paid on the fair value` 100000 FALSE 0 (LIST 3%, 3%) 10 EQUALS NOTHING
-- The Court determined otherwise for good cause: $123.
#ASSERT `How much interest will I be paid on the fair value` 100000 TRUE 123 (LIST 3%, 3%) 10 EQUALS JUST 123

-- The entity paid me $600,000 in cash against a $1,000,000 fair value; $20,000 of interest had accrued and was not paid: interest runs on $420,000.
#ASSERT `On what sum does interest accrue after the entity pays me cash before judgment` 1000000 600000 20000 FALSE EQUALS 420000
-- The accrued interest was paid with the cash.
#ASSERT `On what sum does interest accrue after the entity pays me cash before judgment` 1000000 600000 20000 TRUE EQUALS 400000

